<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price at 99.825.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price at 99.825.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry said its auction of 1.3 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills on Thursday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.825  Stop rate     0.349 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.828  Average yield 0.341 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	  4.4706 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids     1.2998 trillion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 20.8228 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 Dec 10, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity	   June 10,1997</p>
